{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡熱傳一段場面混亂的街頭打鬥影片，兩名男子在油麻地寧波街近新填地街街頭，疑因故爆發激烈口角，隨後失控演變成肢體衝突。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"zfoOPBsIMeTdHxMZVLVqCo3h2AlIGIa-p-eYcqfnmHI.jpeg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026qVx3PKvMfV1790133596.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"zfoOPBsIMeTdHxMZVLVqCo3h2AlIGIa-p-eYcqfnmHI.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片所見，事發時一名左腳赤腳、身穿迷彩褲的男子情緒極為激動，在街頭與一名恤衫男發生爭執。期間迷彩褲男突然扯住恤衫男的頭髮，發力將對方摔在馬路中心。恤衫男狼狽站起並返回行人路後，兩人繼續拉扯。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"09f_wW0GQn98O3gh7pgH3P21Hx16r-zMhffDH4X3wx8.jpeg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20261rAib5X3Jp1790133606.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"09f_wW0GQn98O3gh7pgH3P21Hx16r-zMhffDH4X3wx8.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"p46HDycTs5uPSdwa8atLZS-J7yRS9gcFCH2_XAh9v1w.jpeg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026dh6m5iOeuG1790133622.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"p46HDycTs5uPSdwa8atLZS-J7yRS9gcFCH2_XAh9v1w.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">當恤衫男站穩腳步後，即時揮拳直擊迷彩褲男；迷彩褲男不甘示弱，順手執起地上的拖鞋向對方拍打。兩人隨後持續交手互毆，更一路從大街扭打至轉入新填地街的市集排檔對開，場面相當混亂。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T04:20:20.052514+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}